Supplementary text file for L&H database.

Refinements/Fixes
-----------------

The film database itself has been expanded to include other headings, such
as Director, Sound. The database also now has no 'collected' entries in the
first place, as it is unlikely that any of you would have exactly the same
collection as me! (Yeah, I know, stupid mistake on the first release leaving
all my films in.....).

The scrolling dialog boxes seem to be working better now. Sizing and
position has been sorted out and I've now flagged them so that they will
revert to standard dialogs if there are less than 9 lines to be displayed.

The Statistics section has expanded to show you how many films in total
you've got, how many talkies, how many silents and how many of a specified
year.

The Future
----------

I can see this is going to be a lifetimes work. I keep thinking of things to
add/refine, so I'll start using version numbers in the archive totals so you
know what the most recent version is! So, this one's Version 0694, hence
June 1994.


Once again, any criticisms etc, leave me a message on most UK BBS's and I'll
galdly take note of them.



M.C.Avey June 1994.

